    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You make it difficult for enemies to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> you, or attack objects in your possession.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You get a +5 bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> when an enemy makes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> attack against you, and you get a +5 bonus to all opposed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> checks. All objects that you are holding or carrying gain a +5 bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> when attacked (see <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_an_Object\" title=\"Attack an Object\">Attack an Object</a>).</p>",
